  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 450 F. Place a large rimmed sheet pan inside to heat while you prep.",
    "Toss the peppers and onion on a cutting board with 2 tbsp of the oil, the chili powder, cumin, smoked paprika, garlic powder, 1/2 tsp of the salt, and the black pepper.",
    "Carefully pull the hot pan out and spread the vegetables in a single layer. Roast for 7 minutes.",
    "Pat the shrimp dry. Toss them in a bowl with the remaining 1 tbsp oil and the remaining 1/4 tsp salt.",
    "Push the vegetables aside and add the shrimp to the pan in a single layer. Roast for 4 to 5 minutes, until the shrimp are pink and curled and the peppers are tender with browned edges.",
    "Squeeze the juice of 1 lime over everything on the pan and toss gently.",
    "Wrap the tortillas in foil and warm them in the oven for the last 4 minutes, or heat them in a dry skillet for 30 seconds per side.",
    "Serve the shrimp and vegetables in the tortillas with cilantro and lime wedges."
  ],
